  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know quite a few people with these who use them in AltspaceVR.  The fact that it tracks forearm as well could be useful for IK.  Leap has new hardware coming soon that is far more suited to VR with a wide FoV etc.  Also Leap is going to be built into the new PiMax headsets.\n\nIt would be a good idea to implement support for this officially",
